				"speaker": "OLD MAN FATOOK",
				"text": "WHAT THE FUCK WAS THAT, YOU COCKSUCKER? YOU’RE ALL WRONG, COCKSUCKER. DO IT AGAIN. THIS TIME, DO IT BETTER."
